s also happy and carefree, looking around alone. The further upstairs, the more Si Mian curled his lips, wondering what was so good about the office building. If I had known this, I might as well have gone to karaoke. ….The Su family and the others were arranged to rest in the lounge. On the other side, Gu Mo leaned on the table, stretched out his hand to rub his temples, looked at Gu Qiwen, and said in a bad tone, \"What do you mean?\" The old man brought people directly to him. \"Your dad has something to do later. I'll leave it to you to entertain the Su family. The Su family are my dad's friends. Don't neglect me. You have to take care of me all the time.\" \"No time.\" Gu Mo refused without thinking. Gu Qi turned a blind eye to his anger, smiled and said, \"I don't care whether you have time or not. Anyway, I'll leave it to you. I'm leaving.\" Si Mian was sitting in the lounge, feeling really bored, so he escaped by peeing. After she sneaked around and came back, she was about to open the door when she saw a young man inside through the crack of the door. His back was to the door. She couldn't see what he looked like, but the lines of his back, his perky buttocks, and his slender legs were really charming. Si Mian secretly shouted in his heart, turn around, turn around! But helplessly, God didn't hear her voice and never saw his true face. But thinking of that back, Si Mian became excited. He hadn't seen such a top-notch back in a long time. \"President Gu, this is my daughter Su Xin. She just came back from England.\" Su Jianhao introduced with a flattering and enthusiastic expression on his face. As soon as he heard that Mr. Gu wanted Gu Mo to get married, he specially called his second daughter back from England and recommended Xinxin. After seeing it, Mr. Gu was quite satisfied. He was polite and well-prepared, \"Uncle Su is my dad's friend, just call me Gu Mo in private.\" Su Xin didn't have a boyfriend. Seeing such an outstanding man, she naturally had no